{
  "schemaVersion": "2",
  "name": "POST /v1/projects (made, refused, kept)",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "A project is made with its name trimmed, its folder canonical and its repository, listed, kept 0600 and still listed after a restart (PROJECTS-1); each refused input is 422 (an unknown key 400) and changes nothing, and the same folder twice is kept once (PROJECTS-2); the status lists projects-v1 and project-jobs-v1, still sorted (PROJECTS-11, 15).",
